{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y删减了几处重要的前情和因果依据，尤其S05此前对方持续接纳他的经历、S07判断对方也需要自己的依据，以及S13想把喜欢藏回去却做不到的心理原因，人物心理的连贯解释不如X扎实。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更适合边听边扫：重点有醒目的落点，叙述压缩后仍能抓住每段发生了什么，感受则写成具体、有过程的画面，并且部分内容在音乐到达相应位置时才出现，视听配合更自然。X的优势是心理动机交代得更充分，前情、犹豫和转变之间的因果链也更完整；但右侧大量短词容易形成感受标签的堆叠，细腻程度不如Y。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，代价是牺牲了一部分人物心理的解释深度和故事衔接。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "042599a2-3bbb-4eea-a62f-ab87c1c44eed", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T015926763732Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:00:14.264250+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6ad4678c6eb60d8c0c3993cad2c17d51e789194650a904fa2029156d8c35e6e4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3